request.description:
Paginated rows where availableStock <= reorderLevel.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Low stock report fetched successfully.",
  "data": [{
    "inventory": "...",
    "product": "...",
    "variant": "...",
    "warehouseId": "...",
    "currentStock": 3,
    "reorderLevel": 10,
    "sku": "SKU-1"
  }],
  "pagination": { "total": 5, "page": 1, "limit": 20, "totalPages": 1, "hasNext": false, "hasPrevious": false }
}

Reservation status counts + paginated history.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Reservation report fetched successfully.",
  "data": {
    "counts": { "ACTIVE": 4, "RELEASED": 12, "CONSUMED": 8 },
    "reservations": [{ "status": "ACTIVE", "reservedQuantity": 2 }]
  },
  "pagination": { "total": 24, "page": 1, "limit": 20, "totalPages": 2, "hasNext": true, "hasPrevious": false }
}

Paginated inventory list.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Inventory list fetched successfully.",
  "data": [{ "_id": "...", "sku": "SKU-1", "availableStock": 100, "reservedStock": 0, "totalStock": 100, "reorderLevel": 10 }],
  "pagination": { "total": 1, "page": 1, "limit": 20, "totalPages": 1, "hasNext": false, "hasPrevious": false }
}

Complete inventory details.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Inventory fetched successfully.",
  "data": { "_id": "...", "product": "...", "sku": "SKU-1", "availableStock": 100, "reservedStock": 0, "totalStock": 100, "reorderLevel": 10, "isActive": true }
}

Creates ACTIVE reservation, RESERVE movement, moves available → reserved.
Does not consume/ship stock.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Stock reserved successfully.",
  "data": {
    "reservation": { "_id": "...", "status": "ACTIVE", "reservedQuantity": 2 },
    "inventory": { "availableStock": 108, "reservedStock": 2 },
    "movement": { "movementType": "RESERVE", "quantity": 2 }
  }
}

Sets reservation status to RELEASED (history retained), records RELEASE movement, restores availableStock.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Stock reservation released successfully.",
  "data": {
    "reservation": { "status": "RELEASED" },
    "inventory": { "availableStock": 110, "reservedStock": 0 },
    "movement": { "movementType": "RELEASE", "quantity": 2 }
  }
}

Read-only append-only ledger.

Sample response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Stock movements fetched successfully.",
  "data": [{ "movementType": "ADJUSTMENT", "quantity": 10 }],
  "pagination": { "total": 1, "page": 1, "limit": 20, "totalPages": 1, "hasNext": false, "hasPrevious": false }
}
